      "content": "stop with the platitudes. you're here with me, in the dark, not in some calling center. i meant what i said... the drums are getting louder. if they come through these doors, there won't be any dignity left. just pain. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if it just ended now, quietly, before they get their hands on us. before the horror starts.",
